  AgentPlane is built on Agent Substrate: it runs agent sessions as gVisor
  actors on Substrate and calls the Substrate control plane (ateapi/atelet/
  ateom) for actor lifecycle, checkpoint/restore, networking (atenet) and the
  host-side exec door (Control.ExecActor). AgentPlane depends on Substrate as
  a module and does not redistribute its source in this repository.

  The patches under infra/substrate-patches/ (e.g. the actor exec door,
  0003-actor-exec-door.patch) are modifications to Agent Substrate source and
  are likewise licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They must be
  applied against a corresponding checkout of Agent Substrate.
